  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a 12-inch skillet with a lid over medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 5 minutes, until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic, cumin, paprika, coriander, and cayenne. Cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the crushed tomatoes, roasted red peppers, salt, and black pepper. Simmer for 10 minutes, stirring now and then, until the sauce is thick.",
    "Make 8 small wells in the sauce with the back of a spoon. Crack an egg into each well.",
    "Cover the skillet and cook on low heat for 4 to 6 minutes. The whites should be set and the yolks still soft.",
    "Spoon the warm rice into four bowls. Top each with 2 eggs and plenty of sauce."
  ],
